Libertinus 7.051 (https://github.com/alerque/libertinus), the static
OpenType (CFF) faces: Serif in six weights and styles, Sans, Mono
and Math.  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt).

They are troff(1)'s default device, devutf, through the font
descriptions in /lib/troff/devutf: R I B BI the Serif, HR HI HB the
Sans, CR the Mono, S1 the Serif as a special font, S the Math.
